  "id": "LAW-0466",
  "slug": "contract-formation-07-mechanism",
  "title": "Intention to be bound, without a conclusion — the supplied context surrounds a conversation on two lanes",
  "titleEs": "Intención de vincularse — Mecanismo o relación explicada",
  "category": "contract-formation",
  "categoryName": "Formación del contrato",
  "motif": "Intención de vincularse",
  "treatment": "mechanism",
  "family": "spatial-mechanism",
  "description": "A time-lane diagram of one conversation: Party A's lane and Party B's lane, the supplied order running along both. A's message (●) runs on its solid line from A's lane to B's and B's message (◆) from B's to A's, at equal weight; the events are marked on the lanes with their fictional time labels. Only supplied relationships are drawn; a tracer follows the supplied traversal order and the focus element swells. At the gather the supplied context surrounds the whole diagram — a soft frame and a setting badge — and the footer names it as supplied, with no automatic conclusion. No presumption and no legal effect is stated.",
  "tags": [
    "conversation",
    "message",
    "context",
    "setting",
    "surroundings",
    "no automatic conclusion",
    "lanes",
    "sequence",
    "relations",
    "tracer"
  ],
